{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10351280","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10351280","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1035128001:0":{"text":"私は聖石町の近くにある村に住んでたの。人口は少ないけど、穏やかでいい所よ。","source_cn":"我之前生活在圣石镇旁的村子里，虽然村里的人不多，但安居乐业。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEFDA93FCD611FA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035128002:1":{"text":"でも、魔像がどんどん村に迫ってきて、みんな他に住める場所を探さなくてはならなくなったの。","source_cn":"后面，有一些魔偶逐渐游荡过来，逼得大家不得不另寻家园。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE7F60B4754508D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035128003:1":{"text":"とは言っても、簡単には見つからないから、村の人たちが一時的に住めるよう、私たちの家を開放したの。","source_cn":"但新的家园哪有那么好找，我们就把家里收拾了一番，让大家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DAB7013C998D99E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035128004:1":{"text":"みんなっていうのは、その人たちのことよ。","source_cn":"他们就是村里的大家们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEEAC264A37CD58A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1035128004":{"text":"みんなっていうのは、その人たちのことよ。","source_cn":"他们就是村里的大家们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEEAC264A37CD58A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1035128005:1":{"text":"人が増えちゃって、家が窮屈になったのよ。私たちは他にも頼れる親戚がいるから。","source_cn":"这不是人越来越多嘛……都有点住不下了，反正我们家有亲戚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4D8634F895B3811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1035128006:1":{"text":"それで両親と一緒に聖石町に来て、時々みんなに物資を送ったりしてるわ。","source_cn":"我就跟着父母来了圣石镇，偶尔给大家送点补给。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2C8B7F11D7BEE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"君はどうして聖石町に？","source_cn":"那你怎么在圣石镇？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4F40865CCECDC35B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"君はどうして聖石町に？","female":"あなたはどうして聖石町に？","variant_male_record_index":"62598","variant_female_record_index":"62599","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:担心的玛丽娅":{"text":"不安げなマリア","source":"担心的玛丽娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":1}}